{"page":187,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:1","surah":9,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":"بَرَآءَةٌ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦٓ إِلَى ٱلَّذِينَ عَـٰهَدتُّم مِّنَ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"A release by God and His Messenger from the treaty you [believers] made with the idolaters [is announced]––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَرَآءَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"Freedom from obligations","transliteration":"barāatun","verse_key":"9:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"9:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَرَسُولِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlihi","verse_key":"9:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"9:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those (with) whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَـٰهَدتُّم","en_gloss":"you made a covenant","transliteration":"ʿāhadttum","verse_key":"9:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"9:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"the polytheists","transliteration":"l-mush'rikīna","verse_key":"9:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:1"}]},{"verse_key":"9:2","surah":9,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"فَسِيحُوا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ أَرْبَعَةَ أَشْهُرٍ وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّكُمْ غَيْرُ مُعْجِزِى ٱللَّهِ ۙ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ مُخْزِى ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"you [idolaters] may move freely about the land for four months, but you should bear in mind both that you will not escape God, and that God will disgrace those who defy [Him].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَسِيحُوا۟","en_gloss":"So move about","transliteration":"fasīḥū","verse_key":"9:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"9:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَرْبَعَةَ","en_gloss":"(durin