وهُمْ وَخُذُوهُمْ وَٱحْصُرُوهُمْ وَٱقْعُدُوا۟ لَهُمْ كُلَّ مَرْصَدٍ ۚ فَإِن تَابُوا۟ وَأَقَامُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَءَاتَوُا۟ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ فَخَلُّوا۟ سَبِيلَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When the [four] forbidden months are over, wherever you encounter the idolaters, kill them, seize them, besiege them, wait for them at every lookout post; but if they turn [to God], maintain the prayer, and pay the prescribed alms, let them go on their way, for God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱنسَلَخَ","en_gloss":"have passed","transliteration":"insalakha","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْأَشْهُرُ","en_gloss":"the sacred months","transliteration":"l-ashhuru","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحُرُمُ","en_gloss":"the sacred months","transliteration":"l-ḥurumu","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَٱقْتُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"then kill","transliteration":"fa-uq'tulū","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"the polytheists","transliteration":"l-mush'rikīna","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"wherever","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَجَدتُّمُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"you find them","transliteration":"wajadttumūhum","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَخُذُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"and seize them","transliteration":"wakhudhūhum","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱحْصُرُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"and besiege them","transliteration":"wa-uḥ'ṣurūhum","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱقْعُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"and sit (in wait)","transliteration":"wa-uq'ʿudū","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"(at) every","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَرْصَدٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"place of ambush","transliteration":"marṣadin","verse_key":"9:5"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَإِن","en